        "message": "={{ `\n<div style=\"margin:0;padding:32px;background:#f4f7fb;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#15233b;\">\n\n  <div style=\"max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5eaf1;\">\n\n    <div style=\"background:#0b1f3a;padding:34px 38px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ff9b54;margin-bottom:10px;\">\n        Amazon Review Intelligence\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;\">\n        ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.report_title}\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;color:#b9c6d8;\">\n        Generated ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.report_generated_at}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:30px 38px;\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n\n        <div style=\"width:33%;padding:18px;background:#f5f8fc;border-radius:12px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#65758b;\">Reviews</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#0b1f3a;margin-top:6px;\">\n            ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.total_reviews_analyzed}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:33%;padding:18px;background:#f5f8fc;border-radius:12px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#65758b;\">Average Rating</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#0b1f3a;margin-top:6px;\">\n            ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.average_rating}/5\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:33%;padding:18px;background:#fff4ec;border-radius:12px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a5a38;\">Priority Score</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:25px;font-weight:700;color:#e96f1d;margin-top:6px;\">\n            ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.average_priority_score}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:26px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Executive Summary</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#46566c;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.executive_summary}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:26px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Customer Sentiment</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#46566c;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.customer_sentiment_overview}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding:20px;background:#fff1f1;border-left:4px solid #d64045;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:26px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#a6292e;margin-bottom:7px;\">Top Customer Risk</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#65373a;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.top_customer_risk}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding:20px;background:#eef9f2;border-left:4px solid #2a9d5b;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#207544;margin-bottom:7px;\">Strongest Positive Signal</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#365e46;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.strongest_positive_signal}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;\">Recommended Actions</div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:17px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e96f1d;margin-bottom:5px;\">PRODUCT</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#46566c;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.product_recommendation}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:17px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e96f1d;margin-bottom:5px;\">LISTING & A+ CONTENT</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#46566c;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.listing_recommendation}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#e96f1d;margin-bottom:5px;\">CREATIVE TESTING</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#46566c;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.creative_recommendation}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding:22px;background:#0b1f3a;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:26px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#ff9b54;margin-bottom:8px;\">PRIORITY FOR THE NEXT 7 DAYS</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;\">\n          ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.priority_action_next_7_days}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#65758b;\">\n        <strong>Management note:</strong>\n        ${$(\"05 — Prepare Weekly Report Record\").item.json.management_note}\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:18px 38px;background:#f5f8fc;font-size:12px;color:#7a889b;\">\n      Automatically generated by the Amazon Review Intelligence System.\n      Recommendations should be validated by the responsible business and compliance teams.\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n` }}",
        "options": {}
